*.mp4

# Runtime state that churns every few minutes — added 2026-08-25.
# These were showing as "modified" constantly, which buries a real content
# change (data/PUBLICATIONS.md sat uncommitted all day inside this noise).
# A diff that is always dirty is a diff nobody reads.
data/**/*_state.json
data/**/*.log
data/*_state.json
data/*.log
data/last_compaction
data/last_opus_post.txt
data/session_digest.md
data/log_watermarks.json
data/mesh_replies.jsonl
data/mesh_replies/
data/capsule_composition.jsonl
data/reconstruction_pulse_history.jsonl

# Root-level runtime logs and state — same reasoning as data/ above.
/*.log
/*_state.json
/healthwatch.state
backups/

# Papers Nate sends via Discord — copyrighted PDFs, never commit (added 2026-08-25)
data/attachments/
data/gemma4_training.jsonl
data/phase2_conversations.jsonl
